<title>SINGAPORE: GPE unit in China joint venture.</title>
<headline>GPE unit in China joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPE Industries Ltd of Singapore said on Wednesday that a subsidiary has formed a joint venture company in China to manufacture and supply automotive wire harness products.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that GPE subsidiary China Auto Parts Ltd signed the joint venture agreement with Shanghai Anting Industry Corp. The new firm will begin operations in July.</p>
<p>Called the Shanghai Jinting Automobile Harness Ltd, the firm will have an initial capital of US$1.6 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
</text>
